1051
00:56:53,310 --> 00:56:55,679
Min-gi really was the best!

1052
00:56:55,746 --> 00:56:58,582
Rock and roll! Yeah, baby, yeah!

1053
00:56:58,649 --> 00:57:00,617
Min-gi, please, let's make music!

1054
00:57:00,684 --> 00:57:02,019
Let's go again, Min-gi!

1055
00:57:02,085 --> 00:57:05,622
Yes! He really is the best!

1056
00:57:07,291 --> 00:57:09,626
Huh? Min-gi is here too.

1057
00:57:11,028 --> 00:57:14,932
But that woman next to him,
