1065
00:57:34,618 --> 00:57:37,854
Why is that brat suddenly so cranky?

1066
00:57:37,921 --> 00:57:40,357
That guy still isn't over her.

1067
00:57:42,025 --> 00:57:43,060
He's not over her?

1068
00:57:43,126 --> 00:57:46,997
You see, back then, Min-gi and Yu-na

1069
00:57:48,165 --> 00:57:50,167
