1070
00:57:50,233 --> 00:57:51,635
A fling?

1071
00:57:53,103 --> 00:57:54,738
Ah.

1072
00:58:06,883 --> 00:58:09,553
You chattered all day.
Why are you so quiet now?

1073
00:58:10,253 --> 00:58:13,290
Why, are you thinking
about that Yu-na or Yu-ja girl?

1074
00:58:13,991 --> 00:58:15,759
Hey, snap out of it.

1075
00:58:15,826 --> 00:58:16,827
Yu-na's above you.

1076
00:58:16,893 --> 00:58:19,329
I know, I know that already!

1077
00:58:21,198 --> 00:58:22,532
Are you angry?

1078
00:58:23,367 --> 00:58:25,635
I was just joking.

1079
00:58:37,347 --> 00:58:39,149
I have no time to hesitate.

1080
00:58:40,450 --> 00:58:42,252
I'll confess like a man.

1081
00:58:42,319 --> 00:58:45,622
At worst, if I'm rejected,
I can just walk away coolly.

1082
00:58:45,689 --> 00:58:47,924
All right, let's go, Han-cheol.

1083
00:58:51,995 --> 00:58:53,196
Su-yeon.

1084
00:58:53,263 --> 00:58:56,099
