1085
00:58:56,767 --> 00:58:59,970
Greetings to you.
I have something I must tell you.

1086
00:59:00,037 --> 00:59:02,139
I know it's impolite to say this,

1087
00:59:02,205 --> 00:59:03,373
but I have my reasons.

1088
00:59:03,440 --> 00:59:05,208
What is it?

1089
00:59:07,477 --> 00:59:09,246
-I love you.
-Excuse me?

1090
00:59:09,312 --> 00:59:12,215
I fell in love at first sight.
Please go out with me.

1091
00:59:14,184 --> 00:59:15,819
I don't want to.

1092
00:59:17,721 --> 00:59:19,556
What? That fast?

1093
00:59:19,623 --> 00:59:22,826
Still, you could at least
think about it for a minute.

1094
00:59:23,894 --> 00:59:27,397
Hmm, I thought about it. Still no.

1095
00:59:27,464 --> 00:59:30,067
Why? Why don't you like me?

1096
00:59:30,133 --> 00:59:32,903
It's because I pooped myself.

1097
00:59:32,969 --> 00:59:35,272
But I actually had toilet paper.

1098
00:59:35,338 --> 00:59:39,676
Because the dog bit my nipple?

1099
00:59:39,743 --> 00:59:43,246
-That was just…
-No! I just don't like you.

1100
00:59:43,914 --> 00:59:45,382
Then I'll be going now.

1101
00:59:48,518 --> 00:59:50,487
Isn't that guy a total psycho?

1102
00:59:50,554 --> 00:59:53,056
We just met,
and he pulls a confession on me?

1103
00:59:57,027 --> 00:59:58,895
I got shot down nice and clean.

1104
01:00:00,730 --> 01:00:03,467
It can't be helped, Han-cheol.

1105
01:00:03,533 --> 01:00:05,702
Let's just be cool and walk away.

1106
01:00:06,770 --> 01:00:09,539
How is just confessing enough, darn it!

1107
01:00:09,606 --> 01:00:10,874
Excuse me, Su-yeon!

1108
01:00:10,941 --> 01:00:12,709
Su-yeon, why don't you like me?

1109
01:00:12,776 --> 01:00:15,011
I told you I had toilet paper then!

1110
01:00:15,078 --> 01:00:16,546
-Damn psycho.
-The dog bite--

1111
01:00:16,613 --> 01:00:19,483
I got my nipple bitten
by accident! It was an accident!

1112
01:00:19,549 --> 01:00:21,651
How could I read that dog's mind!

1113
01:00:23,153 --> 01:00:24,788
This is driving me crazy.

1114
01:00:24,855 --> 01:00:27,257
What a total disgrace
in front of Mi-yeong.

1115
01:00:27,324 --> 01:00:30,460
She'll think I'm still not over her.

1116
01:00:30,527 --> 01:00:33,964
And now I have to see
that trainwreck of a woman again.

1117
01:00:34,030 --> 01:00:35,866
I'm losing my mind.

1118
01:00:37,234 --> 01:00:39,402
Sir, please hang it a bit to the left.

1119
01:00:39,469 --> 01:00:40,737
Yes, ma'am.

1120
01:00:41,905 --> 01:00:43,907
-Sang-deuk.
-Mi-yeong.

1121
01:00:43,974 --> 01:00:44,975
In town? How come?

1122
01:00:45,041 --> 01:00:47,844
I'm opening a coffee shop here.

1123
01:00:49,346 --> 01:00:51,715
A coffee shop? Out in the country?

1124
01:00:51,781 --> 01:00:54,117
I'm just trying it for the experience.

1125
01:00:54,184 --> 01:00:56,219
-And what brings you here?
-Me?

1126
01:00:56,953 --> 01:00:59,489
Well, um, the thing is…

1127
01:01:00,357 --> 01:01:03,460
Sang-deuk! What are you doing here?

1128
01:01:07,564 --> 01:01:09,166
Bong-ryeon.

1129
01:01:09,232 --> 01:01:10,233
Who's that?

1130
01:01:13,970 --> 01:01:17,407
This is Bong-ryeon, a lady I'm seeing.

1131
01:01:17,474 --> 01:01:19,576
We have a date today, Bong-ryeon.

1132
01:01:19,643 --> 01:01:21,611
You look exquisitely beautiful today.

1133
01:01:21,678 --> 01:01:22,979
Oh my, really?

1134
01:01:23,046 --> 01:01:26,216
I made an effort, and I guess it shows.

1135
01:01:27,817 --> 01:01:29,886
Oh, my nose.

1136
01:01:30,654 --> 01:01:32,022
I'll get going then.

1137
01:01:32,088 --> 01:01:33,757
-Let's go.
-Okay.

1138
01:01:34,624 --> 01:01:37,394
-You smell nice.
-I changed my perfume.

1139
01:01:40,230 --> 01:01:42,199
Hey, sir!

1140
01:01:42,265 --> 01:01:44,367
