1141
01:01:44,434 --> 01:01:46,770
Please do it carefully! Carefully!

1142
01:01:53,710 --> 01:01:55,612
Oh my, we're out of alcohol.

1143
01:01:55,679 --> 01:01:57,480
I'm crazy, crazy! Without booze?

1144
01:02:04,454 --> 01:02:06,990
Day drinking is the best, cha-cha-cha!

1145
01:02:08,758 --> 01:02:12,229
Oh? Sang-deok, your glass is empty.
Let's have a drink.

1146
01:02:12,295 --> 01:02:14,798
Please stop drinking. You've had a lot.

1147
01:02:14,864 --> 01:02:17,767
What do you mean? We're just starting!

1148
01:02:20,136 --> 01:02:21,504
Mine's empty too.

1149
01:02:24,174 --> 01:02:25,075
Cheers!

1150
01:02:28,845 --> 01:02:30,247
I'm losing my mind.

1151
01:02:30,313 --> 01:02:32,582
How long am I stuck with this woman?

1152
01:02:33,250 --> 01:02:35,719
If I leave, Mom will say
I'm not over Mi-yeong

1153
01:02:35,785 --> 01:02:37,887
