1159
01:02:56,306 --> 01:02:57,707
What is it?

1160
01:02:57,774 --> 01:02:59,142
The Suzy of Noryangjin.

1161
01:03:00,910 --> 01:03:04,047
I looked just like her a few years ago.

1162
01:03:04,114 --> 01:03:06,716
Suzy? What a crazy Suzy!

1163
