1166
01:03:19,429 --> 01:03:21,498
Blow your nose, woman!

1167
01:03:21,998 --> 01:03:25,869
No, well, I can always fix her laugh.

1168
01:03:26,903 --> 01:03:30,006
Oh, I need to go use the restroom.

1169
01:03:30,073 --> 01:03:32,442
