1171
01:03:38,348 --> 01:03:40,450
She smokes too?

1172
01:03:40,517 --> 01:03:42,385
Okay, okay.

1173
01:03:42,452 --> 01:03:45,288
Women can smoke too, I guess.

1174
01:03:49,225 --> 01:03:50,794
I'll be right back.

1175
01:03:50,860 --> 01:03:52,362
Go ahead.

1176
01:04:03,073 --> 01:04:04,074
