1180
01:04:15,719 --> 01:04:19,622
Sure, in life, people can go
to a host bar sometimes, I guess.

1181
01:04:20,490 --> 01:04:22,959
Like hell she can!

1182
01:04:28,765 --> 01:04:30,433
Okay!

1183
01:04:31,067 --> 01:04:33,403
Hey, you're a real celebrity in Seoul!

1184
01:04:33,470 --> 01:04:35,171
And you know so many stores.

1185
01:04:35,238 --> 01:04:38,541
Soon we'll sell everything we brought!

1186
01:04:38,608 --> 01:04:40,377
Gosh, this is so exciting!

1187
01:04:44,047 --> 01:04:44,981
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

1188
01:04:45,048 --> 01:04:48,118
Hey, warn me before you stop the car!

1189
01:04:49,986 --> 01:04:53,022
-Where are we, anyway?
